Description: TDE panel applet for controlling LiteLLM proxy
 LiteLLM TDE Panel Applet provides native integration with the Trinity
 Desktop Environment (TDE) kicker panel for controlling a LiteLLM proxy
 server.
 .
 Features:
  * Status icon in panel (running/stopped/error/starting)
  * Right-click menu: Start/Stop/Restart/Configure/Show Logs/Quit
  * Tooltip with current status and port
  * Configuration via TDE config system
  * Persistent settings
 .
 The applet manages a LiteLLM proxy process which routes AI requests
 to free-tier APIs (Google Gemini, NVIDIA Nemotron, Groq, OpenRouter).